{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1448390-lunar-charm-awakens-dragon-blooded-lineage-2nd-ed","id":1448390,"title":"Lunar Charm awakens Dragon Blooded lineage? (2nd Ed)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-05-12T22:16:56-07:00","id":1448390,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon6.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Lunar Charm awakens Dragon Blooded lineage? (2nd Ed)","content":"A friend of mine mentioned there was a Luanr Charm in 2nd Edition that allowed a Lunar to awaken the sleeping lineage inside a Mortal, one effect being the ability to Exalt a Mortal as a Dragon Blooded if they had a Dragon Blooded ancestor in their past.<br /> <br /> Does anyone know the name &amp; source of this Charm?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4428-daredevil","name":"Daredevil","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4428_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"404"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-13T03:35:12-07:00","id":1448403,"title":"","content":"I might be overlooking some essence 5+ power but that doesn't sound like anything canonical.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts: